{"id":"ko_nigin","lemma":"Königin","pos":"noun","rank":894,"glosses":["queen"],"ipa":"/ˈkøːnɪɡɪn/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/6c/De-K%C3%B6nigin.ogg/De-K%C3%B6nigin.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Königin","plural":"Königinnen"},"formAudio":{"Königinnen":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f3/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-K%C3%B6niginnen.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Der König und die Königin kommen.","en":"The king and queen are coming.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"king"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to come"}]},{"text":"Die Königin stand neben dem König.","en":"The queen stood beside the king.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to stand","l":"stehen"},{"g":"next to"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},{"g":"king"}]},{"text":"Die Königin hat das Museum besucht.","en":"The queen visited the museum.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"museum"},{"g":"to visit, to see","l":"besuchen"}]},{"text":"Er verneigte sich vor der Königin.","en":"He bowed to the Queen.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"in front of, ahead of"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Die Krone der Königin war aus Gold.","en":"The Queen's crown was made of gold.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"crown"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"out of / from"},{"g":"gold"}]}]}